Package: rmvpadsl
Title: A Declarative Analysis Language for 'rMVPA'
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Bradley", "Buchsbaum", email = "brad.buchsbaum@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Describes multivariate pattern analyses of fMRI beta series in
    small YAML files: one project file naming the data, plus one file per
    analysis with a verb (decode, transfer, rsa, encode and others) and a
    scope (searchlight, regions or whole brain). Each analysis compiles to an
    ordinary 'rMVPA' model specification. Provides checking without fitting,
    incremental re-runs, BIDS-derivatives outputs with provenance sidecars,
    the 'rmvpa' command, and a browser studio served locally or exported as
    a static folder.
